[1mwebsearch_to_tsquery[22m[39m on th[33G sparse arm. Shortest diff, fixes the precision failure [90Ghat[94Gstarted thi[109Gread, and deletes[127Gthe[131Ghand-rolled OR builder.[K[2C[1B2[6G[1mAdd a[12G[38;2;177;185;249mchunks[19G[39mtable[22m and index chunks[42Ginstead of documents. Keep [38;2;177;185;249mprompts[77G[39mexactly[85Gas[88Git[91Gis[94G—[96Git[99Gbecomes[107Gthe[111G[38;2;177;185;249mdocuments[121G[39mtable[127Gfor[131Gfree.[137GRetrieval[147Gjoins[153Gback[158Gto[161Git.[165GThis[170Gis[173Gthe[177Gone[181Greal[186Gschema[193Gchange[200Gand[204Git's[209Gwhat[214Gunblocks[223Gdense.[2C[1B3[6G[1mQuery prefix → [38;2;177;185;249m"query: "[22m[39m, re-embed. Two lines plus a backfill[68Grun.[73G[K[2C[1B4.[6G[1mCommit the known-item test as [38;2;177;185;249mtests/test_retrieval_quality.py[68G[22m[39mwith[73Ga[75Grecall@1[84Gfloor.[91GIt's[96Gthe[100Gthing[106Gthat[111Gtells[117Gyou[121Gwhether[129G1–3[133Gworked,[141Gand[145Git's[150Galready[158Gwritten.[2C[1B[K[2C[1BEverything[14Gelse[19Gon[22Gthe[26Gproduction[37Gchecklist[47G—[49Gpooling,[58Ggenerated[68Gcolumns,[77Gcontent[85Ghashing,[94Gembedding[104Gversioning[115G—[117Gis[120Greal[125Gbut[129Glatent.[137GAdd[141Git[144Gwhen[149Ga[151Gsecond[158Gconsumer[167Gor[170Ga[172Gsecond[179Gembedding[189Gmodel[195Gshows[201Gup,[205Gnot[209Gbefore.[2C[1B[K[2C[1B[3mSkipped: dedicated vector store, BM25 engine swap, ANN tuning, ingestion pipeline. Add when the corpus passes ~100k chunks or a second writer appears.[1B[23m[K[1B[38;2;153;153;153m✻[39m [38;2;153;153;153mSautéed[11Gfor[15G2m 26s[39m[K[3B❯ [21C[2B[38;2;153;153;153m? for shortcuts · ← for agents[39m [61;1H[59;3H[?25h[?2026l[?2026h[?25l[H[2C[58B[2mDo the four changes in order[22m[61;1H[59;3H[?25h[?2026l(B[?1000h[?1002h[?1003h[?1006h[?2026h[?25l[H[2;56r[3S[r[H[3G[K[